s10-6-p7 : Block
s10-6-p7 = prose (cons "Transactions are processes over a storage world whose admitted executions state the chosen isolation and durability guarantees. Serializability is a relation to a serial execution; crash recovery relates persisted states to the permitted logical states. A data model represented by a quotient must make its queries respect that quotient. A query that intentionally examines a concrete encoding instead operates before that abstraction or retains the relevant representation information." nil)
